id: pm-jira-gdlw
title: Certify pm-jira on PM CLI/SDK 2026.10.4 and consolidate pending dependency updates
description: "Exact pins, pending Dependabot updates, canonical launcher, full CI gates with unchanged 100% thresholds, packed real tracker npm/native Bun offline commands, read-only GitHub preview and complete review handling; orchestrator merges/closes."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-04T12:12:49.321Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-04T12:34:35.354Z"
author: codex-sol
actual_result: "195/195 pass, zero skips; 100% L/B/F across 2 application files (statements unmeasured). Both audits zero. Strict health exit0 with 1 stale-item advisory. Packed real-tracker npm/native Bun commands agree and export all9 items. Managed GitHub dry-run zero provenance cases. Awaiting exact-head CI/reviews and orchestrator verification."
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-04T12:16:58.700Z",codex-sol,"Consolidating Dependabot PRs #118, #121, #122 and #123. CLI, pm-ops and pm-changelog pinned exactly to 2026.10.4; existing peer floor retained. Full source coverage and packed real-tracker npm/native Bun acceptance will be measured separately."
  "2026-10-04T12:18:54.174Z",codex-sol,npm audit and npm audit --omit=dev both report zero vulnerabilities; zero open Dependabot alerts. Canonical pm-ops 2026.10.4 launcher byte identity and non-directory module lookup regression pass (8/8; old launcher failed ENOTDIR). Managed pm-github 2026.10.4 installed; read-only github sync --repo unbraind/pm-jira --dry-run reports synced=0/skipped=0/planned=0 with no provenance-linked items. CI restoration pin updated without enabling scheduled sync.
  "2026-10-04T12:25:28.464Z",codex-sol,"Initial serialized release:check passed 194/194 with zero skips and 100% L/B/F over two application TS files (operational scripts remain outside the existing measured inventory). Packed real-tracker acceptance caught jira import flags rejected by CLI 2026.10.4: the package never registered its native importer/exporter options. Test-first harness assertion failed, then passed after registering existing PULL_FLAGS and EXPORT_FLAGS via the supported schema API. No floor increase or parser bypass."
  "2026-10-04T12:34:33.582Z",codex-sol,"Final full gate: env -u PM_PATH npm run release:check via pm test --run --progress passed 195/195, zero skips, 100% lines/branches/functions over 2 application source files; statements unmeasured. npm ci and bun install --no-save pass. npm pack + npm install <tarball> @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 into copied real tracker; npx -y @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 and bunx --bun @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.4 both pass jira validate --json, jira sync/import --project CERT --dry-run --json, jira export --project CERT --dry-run --json and jira export --project CERT --rich --update-existing --json. Complete JSON parity; all 9 items exported with certification owner present; independent unbounded list reports 9 items without omissions. pushed=false; no live Jira test; scratch deleted. No new upstream issue required for package-owned flag repair."
